@startuml f3-operator-ws-subscribe
title F3 — Operator opens live observation (WS subscribe)

|Operator|
start
:Open task detail view in UI;

|UI|
:Open WebSocket to GW
 (bearer_token, /ws/tasks/:task_id, upgrade);

|API Gateway|
:Validate bearer_token;
note right
  GW's only logic on WS upgrade.
  Auth + route.
  No state lookup, no aggregation.
end note
:REST subscribe to ER
 (bearer_token, task_id events);
:Receive subscription ack from ER;
:Return WS upgrade ack to UI;
:Proxy WS frames between UI and ER
 for the duration of the connection;

|Operator|
:See live task view
 (events stream in as WS frames);

note right
  No queues. GW subscribes to ER and
  proxies frames.
  ER pushes events to subscribed GWs.
  WS close = cancel subscription.
end note

stop

@enduml